ror_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5126990","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:28:32Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5244640","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1847286114034422","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"A Weight Off Your Shoulders","summary":"A Weight Off Your ShouldersThis one's a fairly chunky update.I've been watching a lot of people play the demo recently, and there were a few points where the game was asking players to understand slightly too much, slightly too quickly.So I've changed quite a lot.The tutorials are clearer, furniture assembly is easier to read, there's a new checklist to tell you whether your lovingly assembled table is actually going to pass inspection, carrying furniture has been rebalanced, and there are some ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:13:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034422","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846651706691006","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"Read the Manual","summary":"Read the ManualA smaller update this time, mostly focused on making the demo a little clearer, smoother, and less likely to leave you wondering what on earth HØLM expects you to do next.A lot of this update comes from watching people play the tutorials and spotting places where the game technically told you what to do, but perhaps not quite loudly enough.So there are now clearer instructions for Focus Mode, better highlighting during tutorial steps, improved booklet controls, more useful Tonttu ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:13:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846651706688071","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"A Room With a View","summary":"A Room With a ViewRestaurant windows, a look at the car park, and clearer briefing instructions.A small update to make the store feel a little more connected to the outside world. The restaurant now has windows, and you can see the car park from the front entrance.Your car may be out there. Unfortunately, your shift isn't over.Changelog:Added restaurant windows with views outside.Improved the store and restaurant exteriors.Added a view of the car park from the front entrance.Corrected misleading","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:25:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846651706685726","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"Taking Back Control","summary":"Taking Back ControlController support, clearer tutorials and a little less interference from the night shift's least helpful employees.The night shift now supports controllers!This has meant going through everything from navigating menus to peeling tape off boxes, turning screws and flicking through instruction booklets. You can switch between controller and keyboard and mouse as you play, with the on-screen prompts changing to match.I've also spent quite a bit of time making the tutorials clear","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T22:27:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846651706679202","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"A Little Light Refurbishment","summary":"A Little Light RefurbishmentNew furniture, rebuilt retail displays, better store layouts and a substantial performance overhaul. HØLM has been busy.Stockroom Syndrome Demo — v261015-2What started as adding some floor lamps has turned into a fairly substantial refurbishment of the entire shop.I've rebuilt the retail displays, added more of them, reworked how the store puts itself together, and spent a considerable amount of time making everything run better. There are new layouts, new furniture, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T20:26:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679202","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846018067936025","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"Please don't yeet the Tonttu","summary":"Another Stockroom Syndrome demo update! I've been making the mannequins a little less relentless and considerably less predictable. They can now randomly become inactive during the night, and mannequins you've knocked over may decide to stay down for anywhere between a second and half a minute before getting back up.So naturally, while making the enemies slightly less stressful, I also added the ability to pick up the Tonttu and throw him across the shop.He does not appreciate this.He now scream","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T11:18:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936025","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846018067931307","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"Tidying Up The Night Shift","summary":"Tidying Up The Night ShiftLots of little fixes here, some behaviour changes, some improvements for those playing in 16:10!v20261008-2 Changelog:Numerous mannequin behaviour and performance improvementsBroken furniture joints can now make enough noise to attract the Echo from a distancePushing the trolley now creates noise that enemy AI can hearScaled down the dinner tray holder and dinner trays in the restaurantThe Tonttu now runs away after being ragdolledShortened the Tonttu’s cooldown timeFix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T20:06:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1846018067926163","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"The Three Night Shift","summary":"The Three Night ShiftStockroom Syndrome's demo has had a bit of a chunky overhaul, largely based on feedback from people who've been playing it.The biggest change is that I've cut the demo campaign down from five levels to three much tighter nights. Also we get right into the scary stuff right away instead of a passive opening tutorial night! A pretty consistent bit of feedback was that the demo was a little too long, and that the difficulty could ramp up a bit too sharply in places. I agreed.Fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:39:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926163","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1845383656386864","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"The old box on the head trick - v20261002","summary":"Players have reported getting wound up by 'the gnome' (the Tonttu), who is quite a lovely little chap once you get to know him, if you haven't annoyed him up by throwing things at him. Nonetheless, here's an update to add some counterplay to the cheeky little fella's 'help'.While I was at it, I made it so that you can pop boxes on the mannequins heads too.v20261002 Changelog:Tonttu can now be trapped underneath cardboard boxes indefinitelyBox flaps can now be removedCan place empty boxes on mann","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:52:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386864","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126990-1845383656380512","game_id":"steam-5126990","kind":"announcement","title":"Stockroom Syndrome Demo Released!","summary":"It’s December 1996.Finnish furniture giant HØLM has opened its first superstore in Norway, and you’ve been hired for the night shift. Your job is simple: get the showroom displays ready for opening.\"Greetings HØLM Family! Today marks the start of a demo period in your employment at HØLM Furniture Store! Check out the free demo to see how great your new life could be building flat pack furniture on the night shift in a haunted store that wants you gone! \"--------------The demo is packed full of c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T09:33:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5126990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5126990":"2026-10-26T08:43:20Z"},"no